  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development Cooperation Section,final activities - Development Cooperation Sectio</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sektionen f&#xF6;r utveckl.samarb, avslutning</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med planeringsdagen &#xE4;r att analysera &#xE5;ret som g&#xE5;tt samt att planera f&#xF6;r de &#xE5;terst&#xE5;ende 6 m&#xE5;naderna av utfasningsaktiviteter. Den totala ber&#xE4;knade kostnaden f&#xF6;r en halv dag planeringsdag &#xE4;r R 2 500 (ca SEK 1 600) f&#xF6;r fem personer, varav en praktikant.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the planning day is to analyse and draw from experiences from the year which is about to come to an end as well as to look forward and plan for the remaining 6 months of phasing - out- activities. The total estimated cost for the half a day planning day is R 2 500 (estimated SEK 1 600) for five people, including one intern.</narrative>
  </description>
